{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DVS00695-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DVS00745-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DVS00734-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DVS00810-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<p>工業傷亡權益會總幹事蕭倩文到現場了解情況。據了解，事發時挖泥機正在斜坡上進行工程，突然翻側，壓中 54 歲的工人。工權會表示，職員已趕往現場及醫院跟進事件，為家屬提供適切協助。</p>\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/DVS00880-1024x683.jpeg\">\n<img src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Payme-500x237.png\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-29T04:22:30.047556+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":88,"images":6,"source":"The Collective HK","fallback":"none"}}